\">Eigenmittel benötigt:</div>\n    <div>Ja</div>\n   </div>\n   <div>\n    <div class=\"font-bold\">Bewerbungsfrist:</div>\n    <div class=\"mb-1\">Fortlaufende Förderung</div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"px-5 py-3 border-2 rounded-lg mt-16 px-6 py-6 border-gray\">\n <div class=\"space-y-4 text-lg md:flex flex-row gap-12\">\n  <div class=\"grow\">\n   <h2 class=\"mb-8 font-bold text-2xl\"><a href=\"https://foerderdatenbank.d-s-e-e.de/institutionen/37969-sternstunden-e-v\" class=\"link\">Sternstunden e.V.</a></h2>\n   <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 grid-flow-row gap-x-8 gap-y-6\">\n    <div>\n     <p>BayernLB, Sternstunden, Brienner Straße 18,\n      <br>\n      80333 München</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n     <h3 class=\"font-bold\">E-Mail</h3>\n     <p><a href=\"mailto:info@sternstunden.de\">info@sternstunden.de</a></p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n     <h3 class=\"font-bold\">Webseite</h3>\n     <p><a href=\"https://www.sternstunden.de/\" target=\"_blank\">www.sternstunden.de/</a></p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n     <h3 class=\"font-bold\">Telefon</h3>\n     <p>089 839311270</p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</div>";
